    <dcterms:abstract>We show a connection formula of the Hahn–Exton q-Bessel function around the origin and the infinity. We introduce the q-Borel transformation and the q-Laplace transformation following C. Zhang to obtain the connection formula. We consider the limit p →1−of the connection formula.</dcterms:abstract>
