    <dcterms:identifier xsi:type="dcterms:URI">https://arxiv.org/abs/1704.02352</dcterms:identifier>
    <dcterms:abstract>We introduce a large class of random Young diagrams which can be regarded as a natural one-parameter deformation of some classi- cal Young diagram ensembles; a deformation which is related to Jack polynomials and Jack characters. We show that each such a random Young diagram converges asymptotically to some limit shape and that the ﬂuctuations around the limit are asymptotically Gaussian.</dcterms:abstract>
